{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は成人の日ですね〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新成人の皆さんおめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今頃は旧友？とか懐かしの恩師とかと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでいるんでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂からは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこちゃん、まりかちゃん、まひろさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お酒の飲める歳になったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非飲みに行きましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(まりかちゃんは2月過ぎたら！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/11/2144519/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はもう4年も前のこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式ではいろんなことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんあったな〜〜と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年思い出します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前日まで行きたくないと言っていたけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行って良かったと改めて思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と同じように行きたくないなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思っている人がいたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな境遇があったと思いますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非成人式に参加することを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってもう遅いか...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく成人の皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/11/2144519/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会、個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は全国握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアは川後のひなちゃん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとふざけて笑ってました〜〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた方ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/11/2144519/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなめろさんもありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして一昨日は個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/11/2144519/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服はこんな感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは1部かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにピンクとかいう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子が着るっぽい色を着たので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し恥ずかしかった（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","sr