だお喋りしていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2016年はもっと乃木坂が大きくなる為に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手伝いが出来たら幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余談ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の注目のところに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な、なんと生田絵梨花さまが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の名前を出していました！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたき幸せ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は気付かなかったのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上司が生田さんって子に注目されてたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうのを聞いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食い入るように見たら本当でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流石こういった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"情報誌は普通のサラリーマンも見てるので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう発見は嬉しいですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当のいくちゃんにニヤニヤした顔で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日経エンタのやつ見たよ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう〜〜（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？そんな事言ってたっけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と安定の愛情表現してくれました（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご馳走さまです（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragrap